#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to use IBM Cloud to manage users with IBM Cloud accounts"
msgstr "Paano gamitin ang IBM Cloud para pamahalaan ang mga user na may IBM Cloud account"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage IBM Cloud users"
msgstr "Pamahalaan ang mga IBM Cloud user"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage IBM Cloud users {#manage-ibm-cloud-users}"
msgstr "Pamahalaan ang mga IBM Cloud user {#manage-ibm-cloud-users}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide demonstrates how to use IBM Cloud&reg; to enable users who have IBM Cloud accounts and gives instructions for users to access the environment.\n"
msgstr "Ipinapakita ng gabay na ito kung paano gamitin ang IBM Cloud&reg; para paganahin ang mga user na may IBM Cloud account at nagbibigay ng mga tagubilin para ma-access ng mga user ang environment.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To manage ID provider users instead, follow the instructions in the [Manage ID providers](/guides/manage-appid) topic.\n"
msgstr "Para pamahalaan ang mga ID provider user sa halip, sundin ang mga tagubilin sa paksa ng [Pamahalaan ang mga ID provider](/guides/manage-appid).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Steps {#steps}"
msgstr "Mga hakbang {#steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these high-level steps to manage IBM Cloud users:\n"
msgstr "Sundin ang mga pangunahing hakbang na ito para pamahalaan ang mga IBM Cloud user:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ensure that the users that you want to invite have IBM Cloud accounts.\n"
msgstr "Siguraduhing ang mga user na gusto mong imbitahan ay may IBM Cloud account.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Go to IAM and [invite users](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/users/invite_users)\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Users cannot be managed until they accept the invitation and log in at least once.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Pumunta sa IAM at [imbitahan ang mga user](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/users/invite_users)\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Hindi maaaring pamahalaan ang mga user hanggang hindi nila tinatanggap ang imbitasyon at naka-log in nang kahit isang beses.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Optional: Modify users' project assignments and access groups from [IAM](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/users).\n"
msgstr "Opsyonal: Baguhin ang mga takdang proyekto at access group ng mga user mula sa [IAM.](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/users)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"user-org\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"user-org\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "User flow {#user-flow}"
msgstr "Daloy ng user {#user-flow}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The user accepts an invitation, then logs on through the [IBM Cloud portal](https://cloud.ibm.com/).\n"
msgstr "Tinatanggap ng user ang imbitasyon, pagkatapos ay nag-log on sa pamamagitan ng [IBM Cloud portal](https://cloud.ibm.com/).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The user creates an API key by going to ([Manage → Access (IAM) → API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys)).\n"
msgstr "Gumagawa ang user ng API key sa pamamagitan ng pagpunta sa ([Manage → Access (IAM) → API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys)).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "For further information, users can review [Install Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit).\n"
msgstr "Para sa karagdagang impormasyon, maaaring tingnan ng mga user ang [I-install ang Qiskit.](/guides/install-qiskit)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"steps-cloud-org\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"steps-cloud-org\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example scenario {#example-scenario}"
msgstr "Halimbawang sitwasyon {#example-scenario}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This example creates the following setup:\n"
msgstr "Nililikha ng halimbawang ito ang sumusunod na setup:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two projects, `ml` and `finance`.\n"
msgstr "May dalawang proyekto, `ml` at `finance`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `ml` project should have access to the service instances `QR-ml` and `QR-common`.\n"
msgstr "Ang proyektong `ml` ay dapat may access sa mga service instance na `QR-ml` at `QR-common`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `finance` project should have access to the service instances `QR-finance` and `QR-common`.\n"
msgstr "Ang proyektong `finance` ay dapat may access sa mga service instance na `QR-finance` at `QR-common`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are three users:\n"
msgstr "May tatlong user:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fatima should have access to the `ml` project.\n"
msgstr "Si Fatima ay dapat may access sa proyektong `ml`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ravi should have access to the `finance` project.\n"
msgstr "Si Ravi ay dapat may access sa proyektong `finance`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Amyra should have access to both projects.\n"
msgstr "Si Amyra ay dapat may access sa parehong proyekto.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "It uses access groups without resource groups.\n"
msgstr "Gumagamit ito ng mga access group nang walang resource group.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Users are defined in IBM Cloud and project assignments are done there as well.\n"
msgstr "Ang mga user ay tinukoy sa IBM Cloud at ginagawa rin doon ang mga takdang proyekto.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Users should be able to delete jobs.\n"
msgstr "Dapat na makapag-delete ang mga user ng mga job.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The steps to implement this setup are:\n"
msgstr "Ang mga hakbang para maipatupad ang setup na ito ay:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Cloud administrator creates three service instances: `QR-ml`, `QR finance`, and `QR-common`.\n"
msgstr "Gumagawa ang Cloud administrator ng tatlong service instance: `QR-ml`, `QR finance`, at `QR-common`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Cloud administrator creates a custom rule that includes the `quantum-computing.job.delete` action.\n"
msgstr "Gumagawa ang Cloud administrator ng custom rule na nagsasama ng aksyong `quantum-computing.job.delete`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Cloud administrator creates two access groups:\n"
msgstr "Gumagawa ang Cloud administrator ng dalawang access group:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `ml` access group can access `QR-ml` and `QR-common`.\n"
msgstr "Ang access group na `ml` ay maaaring mag-access ng `QR-ml` at `QR-common`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `finance` access group can access `QR-finance` and `QR-common`.\n"
msgstr "Ang access group na `finance` ay maaaring mag-access ng `QR-finance` at `QR-common`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Cloud administrator invites cloud users to the appropriate project. Specifically, they invite and assign users to an access group that includes the project.\n"
msgstr "Iniimbitahan ng Cloud administrator ang mga cloud user sa naaangkop na proyekto. Partikular, iniimbitahan at itinatalaga nila ang mga user sa isang access group na nagsasama ng proyekto.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fatima is added to the \"ml\" access group.\n"
msgstr "Si Fatima ay idinagdag sa access group na \"ml\".\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ravi is added to the \"finance\" access group.\n"
msgstr "Si Ravi ay idinagdag sa access group na \"finance\".\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Amyra is added to both the \"ml\" and \"finance\" access groups.\n"
msgstr "Si Amyra ay idinagdag sa parehong \"ml\" at \"finance\" na access group.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Users can log in through the IBM Cloud portal, create API keys, and work with their projects' service instances.\n"
msgstr "Maaaring mag-log in ang mga user sa pamamagitan ng IBM Cloud portal, gumawa ng mga API key, at magtrabaho sa mga service instance ng kanilang mga proyekto.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Mga susunod na hakbang {#next-steps}"

